hYLuZ3tAGPdAC1jYlebZI6Sa0SarcrMExXmfY5XVKR8UoEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUTdUrfmY702ZLR3eNcTdnYoQxVgLRH3c5bs9N8XR65w&oe=69B93DFD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AG Albums 360", "keywords": ["virtual", "tour", "albums", "ag", "albums360"], "long_description": "AG Albums360 - Experience immersive 360\u00b0 panoramic tours directly on your Meta Quest headset. \n\nBrowse your device storage to find and select .vtour archive files. The app automatically extracts them and launches them in immersive VR mode within Oculus Browser.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Visual file explorer with directory navigation\n\u2022 Support for .vtour panoramic tour archives\n\u2022 Multi-language interface (Catalan, Spanish, English)\n\u2022 Language preference persistence\n\u2022 Real-time extraction progress tracking\n\u2022 Optimized for Meta Quest 2 and Pro headsets\n\nPerfect for:\n- Travel enthusiasts exploring virtual locations\n- Architecture and real estate professionals\n- Museum and cultural institution experiences\n- Virtual tours and immersive storytelling\n\nDevice Storage: The app accesses files from your Quest's internal storage (typically /sdcard/Download) to find and play compatible tour files.\n\nPrivacy: No data collection, no advertising, local processing only.\n", "short_description": "Browse and play 360\u00b0 panoramic tours on Meta Quest"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Miniatura_Horizonta_1.png", "id": "4465613507094746", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_4465613513761412_8017434051719727320_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cnp0mLm7E64Q7kNvwH7rpiQ&_nc_oc=AdkK7mtzHzA6-mnbZzH6J7JrD-FPgLV9_6sO0Jq8p8nFWCyjl8R6sl0W2lw_l7kYURM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz-haiJXv2Au_9db3gLNevXSvGnAZQ-e8TYQGEpjLuiNA&oe=69B94D25"}, {"file_name": "Miniatura_Quadrado_1.png", "id": "1657